{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Paradox Reloaded</strong> takes the fast-paced, roguelite shoot \u2019em up to new heights. Featuring fully revamped pixel art and finely rebalanced gameplay, the game delivers intense, nonstop action. Test your skills in the new endless mode, where survival and high scores are the ultimate goal.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the legendary bounty hunter Black Paradox, players will take on the Hellraisers, the galaxy's most notorious criminal syndicate, along with their seven formidable lieutenants. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2977490/extras/ac297000286523fc545008efd2f2ff85.avif?t=1772626200\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgraded Visuals</strong>: Stunning new pixel art enhances every aspect of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebalanced Gameplay</strong>: Fine-tuned for a smoother, more challenging experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong>: An extra challenge for those seeking to push their skills. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive Arsenal</strong>: 20 unique weapons, 37 powerups, 13 deadly drones, and 8 powerful combos, including the iconic &quot;Black Paradox&quot; move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Enemies and Bosses</strong>: 62 different enemies with unique attack patterns and 14 deadly bosses, plus a secret one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stat Upgrades</strong>: Enhance your stats and unlock new powers to become even more formidable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Co-op Mode</strong>: Team up with a friend for double the action and fun.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepageba